WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.235 --> 00:00:34.350
I find compliance with intranasal steroids to be very low.

2
00:00:34.411 --> 00:00:39.930
At follow-up at the one-month mark, I would say it's generally less than 40 to 50%

3
00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:44.401
of parents that are still giving their children daily or nightly intranasal

4
00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:49.680
steroids as recommended. It's hard to know exactly what the barriers are, but I

5
00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:53.460
suspect the word steroid can be very off-putting to parents.

6
00:00:54.571 --> 00:00:59.790
Even though intranasal steroids are very safe and are only delivered to the nasal

7
00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:05.174
cavity and beyond, many parents think that the steroids go through the whole

8
00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:10.470
body and can cause side effects such as high blood pressure, bleeding,

9
00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:16.410
rapid weight gain, and infection, and as a result of this confusion, tend to stop

10
00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:18.390
the steroids very quickly.

11
00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:31.200
I think intranasal steroids are very safe.

12
00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:35.880
We like to use them for six weeks to three months at a time, and then to review

13
00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:40.620
progress. I recognise that parents hear the word steroid and tend to get very

14
00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:43.830
concerned about potential large-scale side effects.

15
00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:48.330
However, this is not the case with an intranasal steroid as it's not an oral

16
00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:53.775
steroid. This leads to poor compliance, and so another option that I often

17
00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:59.370
recommend is that of the nasal saline, which has absolutely no side effects at all

18
00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:04.891
and can often be used as an adjuvant to intranasal steroids or in place of an

19
00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:09.961
intranasal steroid when parents are feeling unhappy to give the intranasal steroid.

20
00:02:10.891 --> 00:02:16.230
It works very well. It helps to clear allergens, it provides excellent symptomatic

21
00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:19.740
relief, and also clears the mucociliary pathways.

22
00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:26.296
The great thing about nasal saline, of which the best known is Fess, is, as I've

23
00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:31.110
mentioned, there are no side effects whatsoever, and so it can be used daily or

24
00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:35.460
nightly for very long periods of time without any concern.

25
00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:39.300
And so for parents, this is often an attractive option because it doesn't involve

26
00:02:39.315 --> 00:02:40.260
the word steroid.

27
00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.810
Children are not young adults. They go through rapid changes as they grow from

28
00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:59.220
young babies into adolescence, one of which is the anatomy around the nasal

29
00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:05.235
passages. A baby's nasal passages and sinus anatomy is very different to a

30
00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.730
child, which is then very different to a young teenager.

31
00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.639
And as you can imagine, the airways and the sinus grow.

32
00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:16.469
Young children are very prone to congestion because the airways are narrow and

33
00:03:16.559 --> 00:03:22.020
easily blocked. This influences the method in which we recommend that nasal saline

34
00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:26.520
should be administered. So while it might be very effective for a young baby to

35
00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:31.291
give drops, in older children and adolescents, we always recommend spray.

36
00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:38.070
As mentioned before, this can be in association with an intranasal steroid because

37
00:03:38.101 --> 00:03:43.065
of the adjunct effect that it has. Or when there's non-compliance or parents are

38
00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:49.020
reluctant to continue with an intranasal steroid, we can often use a nasal saline

39
00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:54.120
as a standalone because of the excellent benefits that it provides with absolutely

40
00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:55.531
no side effects.
